    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seenxeeriib Wuxuu U Hanjabay Yeruusaalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Boqor Xisqiyaah sannaddiisii afar iyo tobnaad ayaa Seenxeeriib oo ahaa boqorkii Ashuur ku kacay magaalooyinkii deyrka lahaa oo dalka Yahuudah oo dhan, wuuna qabsaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqorkii Ashuurna wuxuu Laakiish ka diray Rabshaaqeeh oo ciidan faro badan wata, oo wuxuu Boqor Xisqiyaah ugu diray Yeruusaalem. Oo wuxuu is ag taagay biyomareenkii balliga sare kaasoo ku dhex yiil waddada berrinkii dharmaydhaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa waxaa u soo baxay Elyaaqiim ina Xilqiyaah oo reerka u sarreeyey, iyo Shebnaa oo karraaniga ahaa, iyo Yoo'aax ina Aasaaf oo ahaa taariikhqorihii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabshaaqeeh wuxuu iyagii ku yidhi, Waxaad Xisqiyaah haddeer ku tidhaahdaan, Boqorka weyn ee boqorka Ashuur ah wuxuu kugu leeyahay, War waxaad ku kalsoon tahay oo aad isku hallaynaysaa waa maxay? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan kugu leeyahay, Waxaad tidhaahdaa, Dagaal waxaa loo hayaa talo iyo xoog, laakiin afka uun baad ku tidhi. Haddaba waadiga iga fallaagoobaye bal yaad isku hallaynaysaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal ogow, waxaad isku hallaynaysaa oo ul ahaan u qaadanaysaa cawsduurkan burburay, kaasoo ah Masar, oo isna haddii nin ku tiirsado gacantuu ka galaa oo ka mudaa, oo boqorka Masar oo Fircoon ahu saasoo kaluu u yahay kuwa isaga isku halleeya oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse haddaad igu tidhaahdid, Waxaannu isku hallaynaynaa Rabbiga Ilaahayaga ah, miyuusan isagu ahayn kii meelihiisii sare iyo meelihiisii allabarigaba uu Xisqiyaah wada dumiyey isagoo dadka Yahuudah iyo dadka Yeruusaalemba ku leh, Meeshan allabariga horteeda waa inaad Ilaah ku caabuddaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba waan ku baryayaaye bal sharad la dhigo sayidkayga oo ah boqorka Ashuur, haddaba waxaan ku siin doonaa laba kun oo faras, haddaad rag fuula u heli kartid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal sidee baad u celin kartaa sirkaal ka mid ah kuwa ugu yaryar ee addoommada sayidkayga, oo sidee baad Masar isugu hallaynaysaa inay ku siinayso gaadhifardood iyo rag fardooley ah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba miyaan Rabbiga la'aantiis ugu kacay meeshan inaan baabbi'iyo? Rabbigu wuxuu igu yidhi, Dalkaas ku kac oo soo baabbi'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Elyaaqiim iyo Shebnaa iyo Yoo'aax waxay Rabshaaqeeh ku yidhaahdeen, Waannu ku baryaynaaye nagula hadal afka reer Suuriya, annagoo addoommadaada ah, waayo, isagaannu garanaynaa, oo ha nagula hadlin afka Yuhuudda iyadoo dadka derbiga dul jooga ay na maqlayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Rabshaaqeeh wuxuu iyagii ku yidhi, Sayidkaygu ma wuxuu ii soo diray inaan sayidkiinna iyo idinka erayadan kula hadlo? Sow iima uu soo dirin nimanka derbiga dul joogaa inay xaarkooda cunaan oo ay kaadidooda idinla cabbaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu Rabshaaqeeh istaagay, oo intuu cod weyn ku qayliyey ayuu afka Yuhuudda ku hadlay oo yidhi, War maqla erayadii boqorka weyn ee ah boqorka Ashuur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boqorkii wuxuu idinku leeyahay, Xisqiyaah yuusan idin khiyaanayn, waayo, isagu ma uu awoodi doono inuu idin samatabbixiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Xisqiyaah yuusan Rabbiga idin aaminsiin isagoo leh, Hubaal Rabbigu waa ina samatabbixin doonaa, oo magaaladan laguma ridi doono gacanta boqorka Ashuur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Xisqiyaah ha maqlina, waayo, boqorkii Ashuur wuxuu leeyahay, Nabad ila dhigta, oo ii soo baxa, oo midkiin waluba wax ha ka cuno canabkiisa iyo geedkiisa berde, oo midkiin waluba ha cabbo biyaha ceelkiisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "intaanan iman oo idiin kaxayn dal dalkiinna la mid ah, oo ah dal hadhuudh iyo khamri leh, oo ah dal kibis iyo beerocanab leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iska jira oo yuusan Xisqiyaah idin sasabin isagoo leh, Rabbigu waa ina samatabbixin doonaa. Waayo, quruumaha ilaahyadoodii midkoodna miyuu dalkiisii ka samatabbixiyey gacanta boqorka Ashuur? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal meeye ilaahyadii Xamaad iyo Arfaad? Oo meeye ilaahyadii Sefarwayiim? Iyagu miyey Samaariya ka samatabbixiyeen gacantayda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal waa kuwee kuwa ku jira ilaahyada dalalka oo dhan oo dalkooda ka samatabbixiyey gacantayda? Haddaba Rabbigu sidee buu Yeruusaalem gacantayda uga samatabbixin karaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse way iska aamuseen oo xataa eray keliya uguma ay jawaabin, waayo, boqorku wuxuu ku amray oo yidhi, Ha u jawaabina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa Xisqiyaah u yimid Elyaaqiim ina Xilqiyaah oo reerka u sarreeyey, iyo Shebnaa oo karraanigii ahaa, iyo Yoo'aax ina Aasaaf oo taariikhqorihii ahaa, iyagoo dhar jeexjeexan, oo waxay isagii u sheegeen Rabshaaqeeh erayadiisii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
